            "review_title": "Review at Lau Mam Ba Sau",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nDelicious Southern Hot Pot\nOct 2019\nThis place serves really delicious Ca Tho (a southern city) style food and really good hot pot. The staff was really on top of things though there wasn't any English spoken. Even without English, you can get by just fine. The seafood was tasty though do be aware of bones.\n\nBut, this was a really great place to go with friends!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 13, 2019",
